WEBVTT

00:07:59.475 --> 00:08:02.394
A Chinese vlogger,
who goes by the name Guanguan,

00:08:02.436 --> 00:08:05.231
had taken our map
and traveled to Xinjiang.

00:08:05.898 --> 00:08:07.066
In his video,

00:08:07.107 --> 00:08:09.568
we see him driving down
a main road past a compound

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.238
with barbed wire on top
of the perimeter wall

00:08:12.238 --> 00:08:13.948
and bars on the windows.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:17.993
Next, he pretends to take
a wrong turn down a side street

00:08:18.035 --> 00:08:20.287
so that he can film
the facility at the end.

00:08:20.746 --> 00:08:24.416
The sign on the gate says
"13th Division Detention Center."

00:08:24.458 --> 00:08:27.294
And then he hurriedly turns
his car and drives away.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.881
Later, he hangs his camera
from his backpack